inal residual block (input dimension hidden_dim * 2 into the classification head). 4) INTERFACE: Preserve the TabularResNet class name, initialization parameters (num_continuous, cat_dims, hidden_dim=128, cont_proj_dim=64, num_blocks=3, dropout_rate=0.25), forward signature forward(x_num, x_cat), and LabelSmoothingBCEWithLogitsLoss to maintain seamless compatibility with DataLoader and training loops."}, "parse_success": true, "raw_response": "{
